    Production implementation should read from:
    - Semantic Workspace Learner output
    - Memory Engine
    - Learning Engine
    - Certified Semantic Learning Packs

    This keeps Step 2 connected to the existing learning pipeline contract
    without creating a new reasoning engine.
    """

    workspace_map = {
        "hypertension": {
            "semantic_object_id": "semantic_object_high_blood_pressure",
            "canonical_concept": "high blood pressure",
            "aliases": ["hypertension", "raised blood pressure", "elevated blood pressure"],
            "semantic_type": "medical_condition",
